            {
              "npc": "You can get different rocks in different places throughout the land, explore and find them."
            },
            {
              "npc": "You could start by traveling to the Al Kharid mine. Follow the path north and pay the 10 coins toll to go through the gate. Head north after passing through the gate and you will find the mine."
            },
            {
              "npc": "Be careful though, the scorpions in the mine will attack you."
            },
            {
              "npc": "I could show you where Al Kharid mine is on your map if you like?"
            },
