        {
          "text": "Are there any mining related quests?",
          "steps": [
            {
              "npc": "Oh yes, if you haven't already, speak to Doric who can be found around the anvils north of Falador. I'm sure he can help you out."
            },
            {
              "type": "condition",
              "text": "If the player is a member:",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "npc": "You could investigate the Dig Site east of Varrock, I'm sure you'll find something rewarding there."
                },
                {
                  "type": "jump",
                  "reference": "continue",
                  "id": "31rpUv"
                }
              ],
              "id": "xqcxHu"
            },
            {
              "type": "jump",
              "reference": "previous",
              "id": "SdRrkZ"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell me about different rocks and picks.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "player": "Tell me about different rocks and picks."
            },
            {
              "npc": "Ok then.. here goes...."
            },
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "options": [
                {
                  "text": "Rocks and Ores.",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "type": "choice",
                      "options": [
                        {
                          "text": "Clay and Rune Essence.",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "message",
                              "text": "Clay can be mined in many places. Try south west of Varrock or the crafting guild. See the crafting tutor upstairs in Lumbridge Castle for more information on what you can make with clay.",
                              "id": "agoCGr"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "message",
                              "text": "Rune Essence can only be mined at secret places... I don't know where these are but you can speak to the Duke of Lumbridge to find out more.",
                              "id": "kNlfU8"
                            },
                            {
                              "npc": "You can make all sorts of things from clay, if you have the crafting skill. Rune Essence is used for magic to cast spells."
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "choice",
                              "options": [
                                {
                                  "text": "Teach me about mining.",
                                  "steps": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "jump",
                                      "reference": "initial",
                                      "id": "oXCT9a"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "text": "Teach me about different rocks.",
                                  "steps": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "jump",
                                      "reference": "previous",
                                      "id": "wL7m5E"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "Copper and Tin.",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "message",
                              "text": "Rocks which yield copper ore can be found around here, and other places such as Al Kharid, Rimmington or Varrock mines. They're quite common.",
                              "id": "XPZNLG"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "message",
                              "text": "Tin ore is much the same as copper. It can be found around this area as well as Varrock, Al Kharid and the Barbarian Village.",
                              "id": "58j1-f"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "choice",
                              "options": [
                                {
                                  "text": "Teach me about mining.",
                                  "steps": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "jump",
                                      "reference": "initial",
                                      "id": "bqKBWU"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "text": "Teach me about different rocks.",
                                  "steps": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "jump",
                                      "reference": "previous",
                                      "id": "uLsGp_"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "Iron and Coal.",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "type": "message",
                              "text": "Iron can be mined around Rimmington, Al Kharid and Varrock. It's tricky to smelt though - see the boy at the furnace in Lumbridge for tips.",
                              "id": "PuU908"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "message",
                              "text": "Look for this icon on your minimap to find the furnace.",
                              "id": "__NVws"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "message",
                              "text": "You'll need to be a fairly good miner before you can start mining coal. You can find it in the Dwarf mine, Al Kharid and quite a few other places.",
                              "id": "SGhUJT"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "choice",
                              "options": [
                                {
                                  "text": "Teach me about mining.",
                                  "steps": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "jump",
                                      "reference": "initial",
                                      "id": "uiFwg9"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "text": "Teach me about different rocks.",
                                  "steps": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "jump",
                                      "reference": "previous",
                                      "id": "8DrIaJ"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
